All assets in this directory are included exclusively for the example/demo
application. They are not part of the core phaser-pixui library.

## Minifantasy

Files: `minifantasy/*.png`

Author: Krishna Palacio (https://krishna-palacio.itch.io)
Sources:
- Minifantasy UI Overhaul (https://krishna-palacio.itch.io/minifantasy-ui-overhaul)
License: Commercial, with a special exception for this open-source project.

You are allowed to:
- Use these assets in your own non-commercial or commercial video game or
  audio-visual digital project.
- Edit and alter these assets for inclusion in your own projects.

You are NOT allowed to:
- Re-distribute or re-sell these assets (or altered versions) as standalone
  game assets, images, or NFTs.

You must credit Krishna Palacio in your project credits.

